<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'New capture', captureLine: (identity.name || 'your account') + ' / ready to capture' }) %>
<main class="doc" id="main">
  <div class="doc__in">
    <h1>New capture</h1>
    <p class="lede">Your post text, posting times and page likes are analysed on this server. Each switch below sends something to an outside service, so all start off.</p>
    <% if (demo) { %><p class="bad">Test fixtures: every provider response is an authored mock. The switches use the same consent gates as live mode.</p><% } %>
    <form action="/analyze" method="post">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
      <h2>Clock</h2>
      <div class="field">
        <label for="tz">Your timezone</label>
        <input id="tz" type="text" name="timezone" value="Europe/London" required maxlength="100" aria-describedby="tz-help">
        <small id="tz-help">An IANA name such as Europe/London or Asia/Karachi. Places your posting times on your own clock.</small>
      </div>
      <h2>Outside services</h2>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="openai"><span><strong>AI guesses and summary</strong><span>OpenAI receives post IDs and post text for the guesses; structured findings, source IDs, sample sizes and limitations for the summary; and each candidate sentence with its cited findings for a second model pass as judge.</span></span></label>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="sensitive"><span><strong>Age range and relationship guesses</strong><span>Needs the AI switch. Politics, religion, race, health, sexuality and income are never guessed.</span></span></label>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="personality"><span><strong>Personality traits</strong><span>Needs the AI switch. Tentative descriptions of openness, organisation, sociability and cooperation, with quotes from your posts. No personality scores or mental health assessment.</span></span></label>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="vision"><span><strong>Photo analysis</strong><span>Google Cloud Vision receives up to 25 photos for labels, objects, logos, landmarks and text. No face recognition.</span></span></label>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="localOcr"><span><strong>Read text in photos locally</strong><span>Tesseract on this server, used if Vision is off or fails. Photos stay in memory.</span></span></label>
      <label class="toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="hibp"><span><strong>Breach check</strong><span>Have I Been Pwned receives the email Facebook shared with this app. No other email can be checked.</span></span></label>
      <p class="muted"><br>The capture is deleted 24 hours after it finishes, or sooner from Data. Deleting cannot erase what an outside service already received.</p>
      <button class="ctl ctl--primary" type="submit">Start capture</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</main>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
